      "components": [
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "img": {
              "object-fit": "contain",
              "border-radius": "0 !important"
            }
          },
          "_name": "image04",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image03\" group=\"Image & Video\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Caption\" name=\"showText\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"image-block m-auto\">\n        <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/etherscenn.png\" alt=\"etherscan\"></a>\n        <div mbr-if=\"showText\">\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mt-4 pb-4 align-center mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                Unlock your true path!\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vjFEHaekwV",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {},
          "_anchor": "image04-0"
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".card-wrapper": {
              "background": "@wrapBgColor",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "2.25rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "4rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".card-title, .card-box": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article07",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article07\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"8\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mt-3 mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\">\n            <b><a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan </a>- Web3 | Login</b></h3>\n          <div class=\"row card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b><a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan</a>: The Essential Ethereum Blockchain Explorer</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">In the rapidly growing world of cryptocurrencies, transparency and accessibility are crucial. For Ethereum users, <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan </a>has become an indispensable tool, providing a window into the Ethereum blockchain. But what exactly is <b>Etherscan</b>, and how can it be used effectively?<br><br><b>What is <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan</a><br></b><a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan </a>is a blockchain explorer for the Ethereum network. Essentially, it’s a search engine for Ethereum transactions, addresses, smart contracts, and blocks. Launched in 2015 by a team led by Matthew Tan, <b>Etherscan </b>allows anyone to verify, track, and analyze activity on the Ethereum blockchain in real-time.<br><br>Unlike traditional banking systems, Ethereum is decentralized, meaning there’s no central authority to verify transactions. <b>Etherscan </b>fills this gap by providing transparent, immutable records of all activity on the network.<br><br><b>Key Features of <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan</a><br>1. Transaction Tracking :-<br></b>Every transaction on Ethereum has a unique transaction hash. <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan </a>allows users to paste this hash to see details such as sender and receiver addresses, gas fees, and confirmation status.<br><br><b>2. Address Monitoring :-<br></b>Users can search for any Ethereum address to check its balance, past transactions, and token holdings. This is especially useful for investors and developers who want to track wallet activity.<br><br><b>3. Smart Contract Verification :-<br></b>Developers can deploy smart contracts on Ethereum, but users often want to verify what these contracts actually do. <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan </a>allows verification of contract code and provides a human-readable interface to interact with verified contracts.<br><br><b>4. Token Explorer :-<br></b>Ethereum hosts thousands of tokens via the <b>ERC-20 and ERC-721 (NFT</b>) standards. Etherscan provides detailed data on these tokens, including supply, transfers, holders, and contract information.<br><br><b>5. Analytics and Charts :-<br></b><a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan </a>provides network statistics such as gas price trends, network congestion, and block confirmation times. This helps users make informed decisions about transaction timing and fees.<br><br><b>6. Developer Tools :-<br></b>For blockchain developers, <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan </a>offers APIs, developer docs, and other tools to integrate blockchain data into applications, dashboards, and decentralized apps (dApps).<br><br><b>Why Etherscan Matters<br></b>The blockchain’s core promise is transparency, and <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan </a>makes it accessible. It empowers users to:<br>.&nbsp; Verify transactions independently without relying on third parties.<br>.&nbsp; Monitor and analyze wallet and token activity.<br>.&nbsp; Interact safely with smart contracts and dApps.<br>.&nbsp; Understand network conditions to optimize transaction costs.<br><br><b>How to Use Etherscan<br>1.</b> Go to <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">etherscan.io.</a><br><b>2.</b> Enter an Ethereum address, transaction hash, or token name in the search bar.<br><b>3. </b>Explore the details of your query—balance, transfers, gas fees, contract interactions, and more.<br><b>4.</b> For developers, use the APIs or contract verification tools for advanced blockchain applications.<br><br><b>Conclusion :-<br></b><a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan </a>has become more than just a blockchain explorer; it’s a gateway to understanding the Ethereum network. Whether you are a crypto investor, developer, or blockchain enthusiast, mastering <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/\" class=\"text-primary\">Etherscan </a>helps you navigate Ethereum safely and transparently. <br><br>In a decentralized world, tools like <b>Etherscan </b>are the bridges connecting curiosity with clarity.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            \n          </div>\n          <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start Now</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vjFEI1Lk7b",
          "_anchor": "article07-1",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    }
  }
